        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Gareth Jones, Dave Gahan, Martin Gore, Andy Fletcher\n- Organizations: Depeche Mode\n- Places: Basildon, Essex, London, Paris\n- Products: Beat Pyramid\n- Roles: music producer, engineer, lead vocals, guitar, keyboards, vocals, bass guitar\n\nFacts:\n- Gareth Jones was born in 1954 and is a British music producer and engineer.\n- Depeche Mode formed in Basildon, Essex, in 1980 as an English electronic band.\n- Depeche Mode consists of founders Dave Gahan on lead vocals, Martin Gore on guitar, keyboards, and vocals, and Andy Fletcher on keyboards and bass guitar.\n- Gareth Jones is notable for working with Depeche Mode, Einstürzende Neubauten, Wire, and Erasure.\n- Beat Pyramid was recorded in London and Paris during 2007.\n- Beat Pyramid was produced by Gareth Jones in London.",
